@startuml observer_problem
title Observer - problem: scisle powiazan bez wzorca

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam dpi 150

class WeatherStation {
    - temperature: float
    - humidity: float
    - currentDisplay: CurrentConditionsDisplay
    - statisticsDisplay: StatisticsDisplay
    - forecastDisplay: ForecastDisplay
    + SetMeasurements(t, h)
}

class CurrentConditionsDisplay {
    + Update(t, h)
}

class StatisticsDisplay {
    + Update(t, h)
}

class ForecastDisplay {
    + Update(t, h)
}

WeatherStation --> CurrentConditionsDisplay : bezposrednia zaleznosc
WeatherStation --> StatisticsDisplay : bezposrednia zaleznosc
WeatherStation --> ForecastDisplay : bezposrednia zaleznosc

note bottom of WeatherStation
Dodanie nowego wyswietlacza
wymaga zmiany WeatherStation.
Naruszenie OCP!
end note

@enduml
